                    128.0,
                    771.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Company reserves the right to adjust standards as needed to ensure equitable treatment of all parties. Any adjustment in goals will be communicated to the affected employees and the Union no less than thirty (30) days in advance of any change.",
            "block_bbox": [
                128,
                797,
